# NVO987 Open Bindings

Website: https://nvo987.us/
Identity: did:web:identity.nvo987.us
Identity endpoint: https://identity.nvo987.us/.well-known/did.json

Project: NEXARIUM
Maintainer: Nicholas Van-Orton

NVO987 is an open decentralized web infrastructure connecting identity,
research, archives, publishing, media, decentralized networks, data,
cryptography, and persistent digital identifiers.

Primary layers:
- Individual
- Institution
- Civilisation

Related resources:
- https://identity.nvo987.us
- https://institution-layor.nvo987.fr
- https://civilisation-layer.nvo987.fr
- https://nvo987.fr
